From: Motion Browser Fork Maintainers <motion@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Feb 2025 10:15:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0004] motion: bridge — register MotionAgentBridge at browser startup
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Purpose
=======
Registers the Motion agent bridge with the browser process:

1. chrome/android/BUILD.gn: adds `//motion:motion_java` to the `chrome_java`
   dependency list so the Motion tree (see motion/BUILD.gn) compiles into the
   browser. Dep direction: chrome_java -> motion_java; motion_java never
   depends on chrome_java (isolation rule, docs/UPSTREAM_STRATEGY.md §4.3).
2. ChromeActivity.java: calls `MotionAgentBridge.onBrowserActivityStart(this)`
   from `onStartWithNative()` — the earliest point where the native library is
   up and an Activity context exists. The bridge is a no-op until the agent is
   enabled (feature flag from patch 0005 AND user activation), so this hook
   does not change behavior for normal browsing.

Binding points are documented in motion/README.md and inside
MotionAgentBridge.java itself. The native counterpart
(motion/browser/bridge/motion_agent_bridge.cc) is added at rebase time and
implements content::WebContentsObserver, calling back into the
@CalledByNative methods on the UI thread.

Rebase notes
============
- Paths verified against the documented file layout for 130.0.6723.58 —
  rebase expected: `chrome_java` is defined in chrome/android/BUILD.gn and
  its deps list is rewritten frequently; anchor on the
  `component("chrome_java")` / `deps` block at the rebased revision.
- `onStartWithNative()` lives in ChromeActivity (inherited hook from
  AsyncInitializationActivity); if the hook moves up the class hierarchy,
  re-anchor there.
- Import ordering (com.* before org.* per Chromium style) may need to be
  adjusted if upstream's import block drifted.

Honesty note (spec §77)
=======================
Authored against the upstream file layout as documented for 130.0.6723.58.
NOT verified against a real Chromium checkout — rebase expected.
---
 chrome/android/BUILD.gn                                        |  1 +
 .../org/chromium/chrome/browser/ChromeActivity.java            |  4 ++++
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/chrome/android/BUILD.gn b/chrome/android/BUILD.gn
index 0f1e2d3c..3344aabb 100644
--- a/chrome/android/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/android/BUILD.gn
@@ -2180,4 +2180,5 @@ component("chrome_java") {
   deps = [
     ":base_module_java",
+    "//motion:motion_java",
     "//chrome/browser/android:system_webview_packages_java",
     "//components/embedder_support/android:context_menu_java",
diff --git a/chrome/android/java/src/org/chromium/chrome/browser/ChromeActivity.java b/chrome/android/java/src/org/chromium/chrome/browser/ChromeActivity.java
index 5f6a7b8c..1d2e3f4a 100644
--- a/chrome/android/java/src/org/chromium/chrome/browser/ChromeActivity.java
+++ b/chrome/android/java/src/org/chromium/chrome/browser/ChromeActivity.java
@@ -76,2 +76,3 @@ import org.chromium.chrome.browser.compositor.layouts.LayoutManagerChrome;
 import org.chromium.chrome.browser.dependency_injection.ChromeActivityCommonComponent;
+import com.motion.chromium.MotionAgentBridge;
 import org.chromium.chrome.browser.init.AsyncInitializationActivity;
@@ -1230,4 +1231,7 @@ public abstract class ChromeActivity<C extends ChromeActivityComponent, A extend
     @Override
     public void onStartWithNative() {
         super.onStartWithNative();
+        // Motion (0004): register this activity with the agent bridge.
+        // TODO(rebase): confirm hook name/signature against the rebased rev.
+        MotionAgentBridge.onBrowserActivityStart(this);
 
